Do I need to add any BuildRequires? `fdupes` and `python-rpm-macros` are present. `hatchling` is present. If it proceeds further, `textual`, `typer`, etc. are Runtime Requires, so they might be BuildRequires if tests are run or if build backend needs them, but usually PyPI deps are handled by the backend or pip in build env. `%pyproject_wheel` relies on PEP 517/660 which installs build-time deps automatically if `hatchling` provides them. However, sometimes specific build deps like `textual-dev` might be needed? No, usually runtime deps aren't build deps unless specified.